  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1602.06 “Inner lining” means a water proof, tamper-evident, and tear resistant lining that shall be capable of sealing immediately upon removal from a receptacle.\n\nSource. #13551, eff 2-2-23",
